What the four claims below test, jointly: that summing expected_counts_per_context_methyl_genome_1kb.txt over context per element_id reproduces expected_counts_by_context_methyl_genome_1kb.txt. That sum is what forcing r = 1 means here -- r only ever multiplies expected counts further down the pipeline -- and the per-context file's provenance is established where the published file's is not, so agreement dates the published file to before the regional adjustment.

